{30}{Beyond the bridge you glimpsed to the southeast lies the city of Malicorne. But the mayor doesn't take kindly to foreigners, and you won't be able to pass through the city gates. Even the inhabitants aren't free to leave.}{Beyond the bridge you glimpsed to the southeast lies the city of Malicorne. But the mayor doesn't take kindly to foreigners, and you won't be able to pass through the city gates. Even the inhabitants aren't free to leave.}{}{}{}{ru2261}
